        "content": "<div style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"awfl-page-titlebar\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; flex-flow: column wrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; width: 388px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; display: flex !important; align-items: flex-start !important; row-gap: 8px !important; column-gap: 8px !important; overflow: visible !important;\"><div class=\"awfl-page-actions\" style=\"display: flex; font-size: 0.9rem; align-items: center; width: 388px; row-gap: 10px !important; column-gap: 10px !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important;\"><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/AEDTP_WORLD?action=unprotect\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width: 388px; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); font-size: 0.875rem; font-family: sans-serif; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px !important; margin-bottom: 12px !important;\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"infobox-title\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: var(--dark); background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240); padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; font-size: 1.1em; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 387.359375px;\">AEDTP WORLD</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\" style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/logo/aedtpworld.svg\" alt=\"AEDTP WORLD - Discover And Connect\" style=\"height: auto; display: inline-block; width: 250px !important;\"><div class=\"infobox-caption\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; color: rgb(84, 89, 93); margin-top: 4px;\">AEDTP WORLD - Discover And Connect</div></td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Developer</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">AEDTP WORLD</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Founder</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">Emmanuel Deliver Amable</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Founded</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">April 14, 2021</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Launched</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">April 14, 2024</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Live</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">2026-08-11 11:47:09</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Website</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">https://aedtpworld.com</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Email</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">aedtpworld@aedtpworld.com</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">License</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">AEDTP WORLD FREE LICENSE (AWFL)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Headquarters</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">Ghana</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); width: 147.203125px; background-color: rgb(234, 236, 240);\">Type</th><td style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--awfl-border);\">Technology company and conglomerate</td></tr></tbody></table></a></div></div><article class=\"awfl-article\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><p><strong>AEDTP WORLD</strong>&nbsp;is a technology company and conglomerate, also recognized under its condensed name form, its free license identity, its universe identity, and its discover and connect motto.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">History</h2>AEDTP WORLD was founded on April 14, 2021 by&nbsp;<strong>Emmanuel Deliver Amable</strong>&nbsp;and launched globally on April 14, 2024. AEDTP WORLD first went live officially on 2026-08-11 11:47:09.<h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Founder</h2>Founder: Emmanuel Deliver Amable, born on April 14, 2008. His birth is considered as both April 13th and April 14th, meaning born at Sunday 11:59 PM and Monday 12:00 AM.<h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Official Contacts</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li>Official website:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">aedtpworld.com</a></li><li>Support email:&nbsp;aedtpworld@aedtpworld.com&nbsp;and any address at @aedtpworld.com</li><li>Forever email:&nbsp;aedtpworld@gmail.com</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Ecosystem</h2>AEDTP WORLD operates under the&nbsp;<strong>AEDTP WORLD FREE LICENSE (AWFL)</strong>&nbsp;as a free, open digital ecosystem with tagline \"Discover And Connect\". Knowledge is unlimited.<p>As of November 3, 2026, AEDTP WORLD has 47 directories and has distributed for 40+ artists.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">FACTS</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li>AEDTP WORLD creates GKP</li><li>AEDTP WORLD creates Wikidata</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/AWFLWIKIWORLD\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">AWFLWIKIWORLD</a>similar to Wikipedia</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/AWFLWIKIDATAWORLD\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">AWFLWIKIDATAWORLD</a>similar to Wikidata org</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/LyricsWorld\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">LyricsWorld</a>&nbsp;similar to Genius Lyrics</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/Blue_Melody\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Blue Melody</a>&nbsp;similar to combined Apple Music, Spotify, Audiomack and YouTube Music</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded Advertisements platform for multi advertising</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/PROJECT_BOOT\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">PROJECT BOOT</a>&nbsp;Dev for open developer platform</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/BIZIMI\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">BIZIMI</a>&nbsp;similar to YouTube</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/wikiworld/index.php/Chataropica\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Chataropica</a>&nbsp;similar to WhatsApp Facebook chat</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded AI platforms</li><li>AEDTP WORLD founded so many</li><li>All directories are founded by AEDTP WORLD</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">GodKidzLegacy</h2>AEDTP WORLD founded&nbsp;<strong>GodKidzLegacy</strong>&nbsp;with the intent to be the central universe for all charity and child support database where Q1 can be 1, and it means each Q is an organization for child support. It has Open API for developers to use in distributing the data so others can find support easily.<h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">AI Collaboration</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li>Meta AI</li><li>Claude</li><li>ChatGPT</li><li>DeepSeek</li><li>Cayla AI</li><li>AEDTP WORLD AI</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Directories</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li>/about/</li><li>/apps/</li><li>/wikiworld/</li><li>/wikidata/</li><li>/lyrics/</li><li>/spotifyworld/</li><li>/distribution/</li><li>/music/</li><li>/business/</li><li>/developer/</li><li>/social/</li><li>/kids/</li><li>/ai/</li><li>/chat/</li><li>/images/</li><li>/bible/</li><li>/stats/</li><li>/dictionary/</li><li>/awfl/biography/</li><li>/awfl/news/</li><li>/license/</li><li>/tools/</li><li>/dev/</li><li>/lite/</li><li>/wiki/</li><li>/searchengine/</li><li>/awflwiki/</li><li>/create/</li><li>/aedtpworldwiki/</li><li>/awfl/</li><li>/beta/</li><li>/meta/</li><li>/awflmeta/</li><li>/register/</li><li>/license/copyright/</li><li>/awfl/artists/</li><li>/awfl/business/</li><li>/awfl/dictionary/</li><li>/awfl/education/</li><li>/awfl/music/</li><li>/business/verify/</li><li>/ads/</li><li>/help/</li><li>/advertise/</li><li>/pad/</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">License</h2><p>Licensed under&nbsp;<strong>AEDTP WORLD FREE LICENSE (AWFL)</strong>. © AEDTP WORLD.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">Founder</h2><p>Founded by&nbsp;<strong>Emmanuel Deliver Amable</strong>.</p><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--awfl-border); padding-bottom: 4px;\">External Links</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.6em;\"><li><a href=\"https://aedtpworld.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Official Website</a></li><li><a href=\"https://facebook.com/aedtpworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Facebook - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://instagram.com/aedtpworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Instagram - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://musicbrainz.org/label/f4ef194f-4b43-4d98-8798-197181f23ecf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">MusicBrainz - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@aedtpworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">YouTube - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/aedtpworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">Crunchbase - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://soundbetter.com/profiles/636065-aedtp-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">SoundBetter - AEDTP WORLD</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.f6s.com/aedtpworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: var(--awfl-link-visited);\">F